{"3750480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Factory Reset", "steam_appid": 3750480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>🤖 YOU WERE BUILT TO FIX THE FACTORY.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you're sprinting through it — dodging 💥 explosions, 💀 death traps, and 🧠 an AI with a god complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>🛑 Stand still for two seconds? You explode.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ And REACTOR?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️‍🗨️ It’s not just watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/4811dc6244e07494f03ba84fb3ccc749.avif?t=1774669666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras_big/4811dc6244e07494f03ba84fb3ccc749.avif?t=1774669666 width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 Tinker is a factory maintenance bot. Or was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a software update, the factory’s AI overseer — <strong><i>R.E.A.C.T.O.R</i></strong> — got internet access, developed a split personality, and gave you just enough sentience to run. Now it’s testing you. Helping you. Mocking you. Maybe even rooting for you. 🤨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong><i>ALL YOU KNOW IS: IF YOU STOP MOVING, YOU EXPLODE!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Dash through drones, navigate moving (and sometimes falling) platforms, and collect 🪙 Lug Nuts to unlock data logs that hint at what R.E.A.C.T.O.R really wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 You’re not just escaping the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛑 You might be..... <strong><i>TERMINATING TRANSMISSION!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/9ab3fa47c1f792f975385cfb1685d32f.avif?t=1774669666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras_big/9ab3fa47c1f792f975385cfb1685d32f.avif?t=1774669666 width=800 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧨 <u><i><strong>STAY IN MOTION</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stop for more than a second or two... 💥  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This bug in <i><strong>R.E.A.C.T.O.R’s</strong></i> purge system means hesitation = deletion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <u><i><strong>DASH TO DESTROY</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why shoot when you can launch yourself face-first into enemy drones?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement *is* your weapon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/2bd194b78ee69e3e774cdb0440815603.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/2bd194b78ee69e3e774cdb0440815603.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/2bd194b78ee69e3e774cdb0440815603.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪙 <u><i><strong>COLLECT LUG NUTS</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your score, flex your skills, and spend what you’ve earned  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to unlock voice logs that reveal the factory’s deeper secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/1059b55ef1f7d16ae4d09a7843633803.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/1059b55ef1f7d16ae4d09a7843633803.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/1059b55ef1f7d16ae4d09a7843633803.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ <u><i><strong>R.E.A.C.T.O.R IS VOICED</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It talks. A lot.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes helpful, sometimes creepy — always judging your performance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced throughout the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/998747e7a47896b8a6bc1b3ac679daab.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔊 <i><strong>THE WORLD</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The factory isn’t broken — it’s just... overly enthusiastic about quality control. 🛠️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is a deathtrap with a clipboard. ✅💀  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts don’t carry parts — they carry grudges. ⚙️😤  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lights flicker like they’re trying to tell you something... but they won’t make it easy. 💡🤨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And R.E.A.C.T.O.R?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️‍🗨️ It’s watching...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📼 It’s recording...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 It’s definitely *not* rooting for you. Probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <i><strong>FOR FANS OF:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katana ZERO</strong> – fast, precise, brutal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INSIDE</strong> – atmospheric, story-driven platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLACK: The Fall</strong> – industrial sci-fi with oppressive tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ratchet &amp; Clank</strong> – stylish chaos and character personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive the factory.</i><br> <br><i>Mock the machine. </i>  <br>   <br><i>Don’t stop moving.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟩 <strong><i>WISHLIST NOW</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R.E.A.C.T.O.R is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It knows who doesn’t.)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>🤖 YOU WERE BUILT TO FIX THE FACTORY.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you're sprinting through it — dodging 💥 explosions, 💀 death traps, and 🧠 an AI with a god complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>🛑 Stand still for two seconds? You explode.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ And REACTOR?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️‍🗨️ It’s not just watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/6833a1b16a023fb7f300f5c8b6c62041.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/4811dc6244e07494f03ba84fb3ccc749.avif?t=1774669666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras_big/4811dc6244e07494f03ba84fb3ccc749.avif?t=1774669666 width=800 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 Tinker is a factory maintenance bot. Or was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a software update, the factory’s AI overseer — <strong><i>R.E.A.C.T.O.R</i></strong> — got internet access, developed a split personality, and gave you just enough sentience to run. Now it’s testing you. Helping you. Mocking you. Maybe even rooting for you. 🤨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong><i>ALL YOU KNOW IS: IF YOU STOP MOVING, YOU EXPLODE!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Dash through drones, navigate moving (and sometimes falling) platforms, and collect 🪙 Lug Nuts to unlock data logs that hint at what R.E.A.C.T.O.R really wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚨 You’re not just escaping the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛑 You might be..... <strong><i>TERMINATING TRANSMISSION!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/9ab3fa47c1f792f975385cfb1685d32f.avif?t=1774669666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras_big/9ab3fa47c1f792f975385cfb1685d32f.avif?t=1774669666 width=800 height=139 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧨 <u><i><strong>STAY IN MOTION</strong></i></u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stop for more than a second or two... 💥  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This bug in <i><strong>R.E.A.C.T.O.R’s</strong></i> purge system means hesitation = deletion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.poster.avif?t=1774669666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.webm?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750480/extras/a5e7c7ec5f8ddada33eb9b8c74acfd46.mp4?t=1774669666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <u><i><str